00:26:51.459 --> 00:26:55.189
And it said for the first time unequivocally

00:26:55.189 --> 00:26:58.564
climate change that we are witnessing

00:26:58.564 --> 00:27:00.418
is caused by human beings.

00:27:00.418 --> 00:27:02.319
