00:27:14.896 --> 00:27:17.297
The United nations framework on climate change,

00:27:17.297 --> 00:27:18.345
the UN FCC,

00:27:18.345 --> 00:27:20.629
which does the conference of the parties every year

00:27:20.629 --> 00:27:23.479
and the 26th one will occur in Glasgow

00:27:23.479 --> 00:27:25.549
in the first week of November.

00:27:25.549 --> 00:27:29.200
And, but two things came out of it,

00:27:29.200 --> 00:27:32.848
which are some good news and it oddly enough,

00:27:32.848 --> 00:27:36.098
which is that, the science has changed.

00:27:37.179 --> 00:27:38.360
So now we know that

00:27:38.360 --> 00:27:42.277
as soon as we stop increasing greenhouse gases,

00:27:43.657 --> 00:27:45.824
that is net zero emissions

00:27:46.764 --> 00:27:49.909
that actually warming will level off right away.

00:27:49.909 --> 00:27:53.855
It used to be that up until this assessment

00:27:53.855 --> 00:27:55.688
that we were baking in

00:27:56.617 --> 00:28:00.965
increasing global warming for decades if not centuries,

00:28:00.965 --> 00:28:03.328
which kind of was a disincentive of ,

00:28:03.328 --> 00:28:05.548
if we get it right, we're still screwed kind of thing.

00:28:05.548 --> 00:28:07.039
And now they said, no, no.

00:28:07.039 --> 00:28:10.598
So it's providing a very powerful incentive

00:28:10.598 --> 00:28:14.246
for countries and companies and people

00:28:14.246 --> 00:28:17.118
in cities to accelerate that move

00:28:17.118 --> 00:28:19.468
towards net zero emissions.

00:28:19.468 --> 00:28:21.239
The other thing it said though,

00:28:21.239 --> 00:28:22.577
which is the bad news,

00:28:22.577 --> 00:28:26.994
which is there are irreversible changes now in effect

00:28:27.839 --> 00:28:29.909
that can't be reversed.

00:28:29.909 --> 00:28:32.318
And one of them is melting of ice.

00:28:32.318 --> 00:28:34.149
One of them is sea level rise.

00:28:34.149 --> 00:28:36.899
And so there is no question that,

00:28:38.286 --> 00:28:40.459
low lying cities like the Miamis and others

00:28:40.459 --> 00:28:44.639
will be, Venice, unfortunately, will be flooded,

00:28:44.639 --> 00:28:48.687
will be underwater by the end of the century or before.

00:28:48.687 --> 00:28:51.918
And so our work is cut out for us,

00:28:51.918 --> 00:28:56.285
but I do think that the most important thing

00:28:56.285 --> 00:28:57.364
is that there's a hundred

00:28:57.364 --> 00:29:00.576
and I forget the number of 180, some other countries

00:29:00.576 --> 00:29:04.159
that are participating in this IPCC report.

00:29:05.966 --> 00:29:08.799
And it's called consensus science,

00:29:11.246 --> 00:29:15.440
and there's no such thing as consensus science

00:29:15.440 --> 00:29:16.880
is evidentiary.

