00:33:45.329 --> 00:33:46.549
Should we do it? Not do it?

00:33:46.549 --> 00:33:47.880
You wanna do every one of them,

00:33:47.880 --> 00:33:49.207
every one of them.

00:33:49.207 --> 00:33:50.909
And I think what regeneration,

00:33:50.909 --> 00:33:52.560
the point it tries to make is

00:33:52.560 --> 00:33:55.920
that we have focused for so long

00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:59.421
on this idea that there's a small select,

00:33:59.421 --> 00:34:03.298
intelligent, informed finance group of people

00:34:03.298 --> 00:34:05.670
