00:34:43.730 --> 00:34:45.820
It could be food, it could be income,

00:34:45.820 --> 00:34:46.653
it could be a job.

00:34:46.653 --> 00:34:47.806
It could be safety.

00:34:47.806 --> 00:34:50.838
It could be food security back to food,

00:34:50.838 --> 00:34:52.237
getting the kids to school,

00:34:52.237 --> 00:34:55.180
getting them in school, affording books.

00:34:55.180 --> 00:34:57.119
I mean, it goes on and on.

00:34:57.119 --> 00:35:00.140
This is what the bulk of humanity wakes up with

00:35:00.140 --> 00:35:01.066
every morning.

00:35:01.066 --> 00:35:03.719
