00:35:14.139 --> 00:35:16.467
they do need clean water.

00:35:16.467 --> 00:35:19.638
They do need better farming techniques.

00:35:19.638 --> 00:35:21.157
They do need cleaner food.

00:35:21.157 --> 00:35:25.021
They do all these things that are synonymous

00:35:25.021 --> 00:35:27.859
with actually reversing global warming,

00:35:27.859 --> 00:35:30.538
actually reverses human suffering as well.

00:35:30.538 --> 00:35:32.210
Promoting equity for all.

00:35:32.210 --> 00:35:34.158
And that's a big part of the book,

00:35:34.158 --> 00:35:36.241
