00:40:07.726 --> 00:40:10.396
or we wouldn't be having this conversation, right?

00:40:10.396 --> 00:40:12.695
Right. And they do it without our intervention.

00:40:12.695 --> 00:40:13.706
So planetarily,

00:40:13.706 --> 00:40:15.946
this is a combination of getting out of the way

00:40:15.946 --> 00:40:18.587
and allowing things to heal themselves

00:40:18.587 --> 00:40:20.845
