No, it doesn't.

01:36:24.195 --> 01:36:27.586
And meanwhile, amidst that consumption,

01:36:27.586 --> 01:36:31.237
there's a tremendous amount of waste, right?

01:36:31.237 --> 01:36:32.356
We're wasting food,

01:36:32.356 --> 01:36:34.627
We're disposing of our clothes.

01:36:34.627 --> 01:36:36.807
Everything is disposable.

01:36:36.807 --> 01:36:37.698
Yes. I mean,

