01:37:01.477 --> 01:37:03.353
40% of our food is wasted.

01:37:03.353 --> 01:37:06.058
That's wild.
It's crazy, and...

01:37:06.058 --> 01:37:09.547
Where's the grave amount of that waste coming from?

01:37:09.547 --> 01:37:12.125
The greatest proportion is the farm,

01:37:12.125 --> 01:37:15.958
the second, but that depends on the continent.

01:37:16.838 --> 01:37:17.825
Meaning they harvest

01:37:17.825 --> 01:37:21.006
a portion of the harvest just gets tossed out

01:37:21.006 --> 01:37:22.378
