can we have a 10 to 12%, 14% improvement here?

02:12:25.786 --> 02:12:29.156
Like more trees, more grasslands,

02:12:29.156 --> 02:12:33.214
or can we change the grazing strategies and technologies?

02:12:33.214 --> 02:12:34.955
Can we change the farming strategy?

02:12:34.955 --> 02:12:39.382
Can we undesertify the two to 3 billion hectares of land

02:12:39.382 --> 02:12:40.305
and so forth?

02:12:40.305 --> 02:12:41.643
Heck yeah!

02:12:41.643 --> 02:12:42.476
We can.

02:12:42.476 --> 02:12:45.004
So that's just in protection.

02:12:45.004 --> 02:12:47.677
That's not technology, that's not energy.

02:12:47.677 --> 02:12:51.293
That's, there's many other things we can do

02:12:51.293 --> 02:12:53.593
that are solutions that we've talked about.

02:12:53.593 --> 02:12:55.064
It's just political on community well,

02:12:55.064 --> 02:12:57.003
but if it's not asking a lot,

02:12:57.003 --> 02:13:00.895
if every community could incrementally improve by 10%

02:13:00.895 --> 02:13:02.914
through a variety of measures, it seems.

02:13:02.914 --> 02:13:04.692
highly achievable.

02:13:04.692 --> 02:13:06.015
Very achievable.

02:13:06.015 --> 02:13:08.105
And so it's important that we have,

02:13:08.105 --> 02:13:11.985
