02:20:45.833 --> 02:20:49.415
and go with and find exactly where it was and stop it.

02:20:49.415 --> 02:20:50.248
Right.

02:20:50.248 --> 02:20:51.294
Then you're like, tell me more.

02:20:51.294 --> 02:20:53.716
What is that forest?

02:20:53.716 --> 02:20:55.314
And how'd you figure that out.

02:20:55.314 --> 02:20:58.747
And I mean, it opens up the conversation,

02:20:58.747 --> 02:21:00.726
but you're doing something

02:21:00.726 --> 02:21:02.087
