02:21:02.087 --> 02:21:03.835
And that's what somebody is doing by the way.

02:21:03.835 --> 02:21:05.184
I'm not saying that.

02:21:05.184 --> 02:21:07.315
And so it again,

02:21:07.315 --> 02:21:09.704
